  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy favors random_walk in clear exploration, inserts short move_forward pulses for coverage, and uses one-shot directed turn recovery on obstacle events. Action states self-loop on path_clear so intended pulses are not preempted, while obstacle events can still force safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two simple plant automata",
    "Use one main policy specification plus a small alternation specification to avoid long forward streaks while preserving fast return to exploration"
